{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53617","headline":"白云亭 · 沈传师","name":"白云亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"僧爱白云溪上飞，白云深处敞禅扉。\n莫言便是无情物，思着故乡依旧归。\n（见嘉庆二十年洪亮吉纂《宁国府志》卷二四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈传师","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}